<oops:Code>P35</oops:Code><oops:Name>Untyped property</oops:Name>
<oops:Description>An ontology element is used as a property without having been explicitly declared as such using the primitives rdf:Property, owl:ObjectProperty or owl:DatatypeProperty. This pitfall is related with the common problems listed in [8].	</oops:Description>
<oops:Importance>Important</oops:Importance>
<oops:NumberAffectedElements>9</oops:NumberAffectedElements>
